WEBVTT

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:24.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:35.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:42.810
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:49.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:58.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:04.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:11.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:18.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:41.670
Kaiba barged into the KC Grand Prix finals to duel Sieg for Kaiba Corporation's honor.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:46.070
He was cornered by the same Goddess combo that punished Jonouchi.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:49.620
But Kaiba's confidence never wavered.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:53.590
In the end, he defeated Sieg with an overwhelming attack.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.610
Like he always does.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:03.310
Duel King Decider Match
Yugi vs Leon

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:14.220
I hate to see Kaiba win, but we can't let that punk get what he wants.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:19.220
He did all that for revenge.  How annoying.

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:22.990
He's a great duelist.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.270
So why did he resort to this?

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.760
My other self?

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.800
Kaiba…

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:38.440
You showed your fighting spirit in this duel.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:42.400
Yugi, I got rid of the rat.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:46.320
So you better have a duel worthy of the Duel King.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:50.930
Big brother!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.920
You’re awesome!

00:02:53.920 --> 00:03:01.180
Now our rivals around the world know that it's foolish to fight against Kaiba Corporation.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.160
So it wasn't a complete waste of time.

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:07.890
Isono!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.250
Prepare Yugi’s duel immediately.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.950
Yes, sir!  But what should we do about him?

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.490
Leave him.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:18.950
He can't do anything anymore!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.430
Big brother!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:31.520
Show him Kaiba Corporation's success!

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.800
As a reintroduction...

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:40.800
The first king of Kaiba Corporation's KC Grand Prix is...

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:44.550
Leon Wilson!

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:53.810
He's been granted the highest honor given to any duelist!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:58.650
The right to challenge the Duel King, Yugi Muto!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:03.690
An intense battle is about to begin!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.500
This is the final arena - Blue-Eyes Castle.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.350
Wow!  We got VIP seats!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.690
Are you sure, Mokuba?

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.680
You didn't have to give us these seats.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.490
I'm sure!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.740
I put you in a lot of trouble, and you helped me out.

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:36.180
This is the best spot to cheer for Yugi.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.030
Thank you, Mokuba.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:40.000
It’s finally starting.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.010
The battle to decide the true Duel King.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:43.960
Yeah.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.460
My other self, it's time.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.400
Yeah.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:54.270
Since Leon is our opponent, it should be a fun duel.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:58.720
Give it your all, and you'll have no regrets.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.580
Let's go, partner!

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:46.500
Viewers worldwide, can you feel the excitement and passion?

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.370
And hear the cheers for both duelists?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:55.370
The Duel King, Yugi Muto is making his entrance!

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:11.680
Yugi, I made it this far.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:14.960
Dueling you is my dream.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:19.600
I kept dueling so I could achieve this dream.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.600
But today…

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:26.770
A historic duel to determine the Duel King will now begin!

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:29.580
Will the challenger Leon Wilson win?

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.480
Or will it be Yugi Muto?

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.850
Let’s have a great duel.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.520
Leon?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.920
Both duelists are in position.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:51.190
And a special guest will start the duel!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.820
Is it me?

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.830
Of course not!  It's my big brother!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.520
Kaiba...

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:08.910
The KC Grand Prix is brought to you by Kaiba Corporation.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:13.090
Sheesh.  Kaiba is showing off again.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.420
It's only natural.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:19.490
This duel tournament is an important event for Kaiba Corporation's future.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:24.420
But I think Kaiba would rather duel Yugi than stand up there.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:30.130
Yeah.  My brother is more worthy of dueling Yugi than anyone else.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.430
But he’s standing there for Kaiba Corporation-

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:37.100
No, he's standing there for our dream.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:41.660
You're right.  As a duelist, I know how it feels to want to battle Yugi.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.640
I want to duel him too.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:47.490
But Leon was the one who won.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.830
Yeah.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:53.470
For all the duelists who lost, I want him to do his best.

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:59.020
Among the duelists chosen worldwide, these two survived their fierce battles!

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.900
You should feel honored to be standing here!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:09.440
Show the world a battle worthy of the Duel King title!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:12.440
Now seize victory!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.480
Start the duel!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:16.980
Here I go!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.440
I go first!

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:22.820
I draw!

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:26.490
I summon Forest Wolf in attack position!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.280
Forest Wolf?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.690
What kind of card is that?

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:33.530
It’s...

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.140
I end my turn.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.480
My turn!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.700
I draw!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.060
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:44.480
Polymerization!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.580
I Fusion Summon using two monsters in my hand!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:53.460
I fuse Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts and Berfomet!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:59.490
I summon Chimera the Flying Mythical Beast!

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:02.370
Chimera attacks Forest Wolf!

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:12.570
Nice!  Yugi got the first hit!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.160
I end my turn.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.330
Yugi, you really are incredible.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:22.980
Now that I'm actually dueling you, I sense your overwhelming strength.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:27.340
I've admired you and dreamed of dueling you.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:31.700
Though this isn't how I pictured it, my dream has come true!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.300
I summon Little Red Riding Hood in defense position!

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.760
How cute!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.950
Leon’s deck has a lot of cards like that.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.920
Yeah.  It’s like a Fairy Tale Deck.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.780
It may look cute, but don’t let that fool you!

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.340
What do you mean?

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:57.460
You can't understand unless you dueled him.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:58.620
I end my turn.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.630
What?  He’s not setting a card?

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:03.490
Something’s not right.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.720
He's acting different than in our duel.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.380
Leon Wilson…

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.550
I watched all the duelists, so I've seen his duels.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.460
Something's different about him now.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.940
Has he been holding back this entire time?

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.700
What's going on with Leon?

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:25.700
Partner?

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:29.710
He's been enjoying his duel so far, but now…

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:32.490
Yeah.  Something's different.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:37.980
When Leon was enjoying his duels, he wasn't making those eyes.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.750
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.060
What's this?

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:48.840
It can’t be!

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.380
I must inform Master Seto immediately!

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:23.130
I summon Obnoxious Celtic Guard in attack position!

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.930
Obnoxious Celtic Guard attacks Little Red Riding Hood!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.560
Nice!  Yugi landed another attack!

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.770
I feel bad for Leon, but this'll be over soon!

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.700
It won’t be that easy.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:56.160
Leon’s monsters all have effects.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.730
Little Red Riding Hood's effect activates!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:06.560
When it's destroyed in battle, I can Special Summon a Level 4 or lower Warrior!

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:10.860
I summon Forest Hunter in attack position!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.510
When Forest Hunter is summoned...

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:21.520
...I can remove one Beast or Beast-Warrior from play!

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.160
What?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:28.510
Forest Hunter, remove Chimera from play!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.770
Fire!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.530
Yugi!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:47.360
I told you that Leon’s deck has powers we don't know about.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:51.520
And he's acting different than when he dueled me.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.320
What do you mean?

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.980
Maybe he's just nervous.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:13:00.400
When he dueled me, he was enjoying the duel.

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:06.540
But he's not having fun now, even though he’s getting to duel Yugi.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.040
I end my turn.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:10.660
Yugi!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:17.780
It was my dream to duel you, a true duelist that I admire.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:23.650
But I'm now dueling you to fulfill my mission!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.810
His mission?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.330
Big trouble, Master Seto!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.740
Look at this!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:35.570
I kept running background checks on our duelists and found this!

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:37.710
I see.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.200
So you finally know, Kaiba.

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:43.880
So this is your doing, Sieg.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.070
Yes.  Everything is going as planned.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:52.590
Another child of the Schroeders entered under a false name.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:59.480
Yes.  He's my brother and a dueling prodigy.

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:02.450
Leonheart von Schroeder.

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:05.920
Leon, playtime is over!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.460
Show them your true power!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.460
Okay, brother!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.840
Brother?

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:14.230
Leon, what's going on?

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.240
Leon…

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:21.240
You were satisfied with beating me, so you forgot to follow through.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:24.760
But I had another plan ready.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:30.750
Kaiba Corporation put a lot of work into this event, and the whole world is watching.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:36.000
And my brother Leonheart will defeat the Duel King, Yugi Muto.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:39.060
What will the viewers think?

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:43.870
They'll never forget about the Schroeders.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:49.150
And soon, Schroeder Company will announce its newest game.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:56.520
Since everyone will know about the Schroeders, they'll buy our new game!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.990
So you're stealing my company's strategy.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:05.890
You finally understand my plan, Kaiba.

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:10.620
I didn't care if I win or lose a duel.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:16.170
As long as I prove that I’m a greater businessman than you.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:19.160
Stop insulting dueling!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.610
You’re the worst!

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.970
Master Seto, shall we stop the duel?

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:27.920
You can't disqualify Leonheart, like you did with me.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.140
This duel has already begun.

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:34.880
If you stop it, the KC Grand Prix fails during its main event.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.180
You'll lose face.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:40.600
Even though I would prefer that.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:47.480
It's going as planned?  You fool!

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:53.710
Yugi Muto is the only person in the world that I acknowledge to be my rival!

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:56.740
Your brother has no chance to defeat him!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:16:01.730
And your plan fails if Yugi doesn’t lose.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:07.510
And I'm the only duelist who can defeat Yugi!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.290
Such confidence.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.390
Yeah.

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:12.780
That’s Kaiba for you.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:15.470
Continue the duel!

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:20.800
You can stand here and watch your plan fail!

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:26.060
Yugi, I won't allow you to lose to any duelist, other than me.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:27.840
Kaiba…

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.630
Leonheart!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:33.710
As a proud Schroeder, and as my brother…

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.120
Defeat Yugi Muto!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.970
Live up to my parents' expectations!

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.500
I know, brother.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.850
Here I come, Yugi!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:52.380
Leon...  I don't think he always intended to deceive us.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:54.170
Neither do I.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:58.330
Leon!  Is this really what you want?

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.130
Is this the duel you wanted?

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:04.410
Aren't you a true duelist?

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.090
Don’t let him trick you, Leonheart!

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.180
Defeat Yugi Muto with all your might!

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:16.030
When you win, you’ll be recognized as a true Schroeder!

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:18.780
Mother will be so happy!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.930
Don't forget that!

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:22.050
Right!

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.650
Leon...

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.930
Yugi, I understand what you’re saying.

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:30.460
I did become a duelist because I looked up to you.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:33.440
But I want to help my brother!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:38.570
After never having a place among the Schroeders, my brother now needs me.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.320
That's why I...

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:46.990
Sieg!  Siegfried, your tutor’s waiting.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:49.160
Brother!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:50.920
Teach me this!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.190
Brother-

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:54.860
No, Leonheart.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.980
Siegfried has to study.

00:17:57.980 --> 00:17:58.620
Okay.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:06.240
Siegfried, carry on the Schroeder name and restore our honor.

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.160
Yes, Mother.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:13.280
Leonheart, don't distract Siegfried.  Understood?

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.880
Okay, Mother.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:21.240
My brother was the hope for our family.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.500
And he had the talent to live up to those expectations.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:33.070
I was proud of my brother, but I couldn't do anything for him.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:42.090
But when I learned about Duel Monsters, it changed my life.

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:47.850
I was fixated on my favorite fairy tale cards and Yugi's duels.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:53.520
What I only imagined was now reality.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:11.960
The more I learned about duels, the more I fell in love with this wonderful world.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.120
I draw!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:29.410
Leon Wilson wins!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.100
Brother!

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.120
I-I can explain...

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:44.490
I know you’ve been entering tournaments for a while.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:51.940
You used a computer to hack data and create a fake name and background.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.650
I checked you out.

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.680
I-I’m sorry.

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:58.460
I wanted to be a duelist!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:02.330
But if asked our parents, they'd object.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:05.150
I’m not angry.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:10.700
In fact, I’m happy that I have a wonderful brother.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:16.880
Leonheart, you have exceptional computer and hacking skills.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:22.030
But what the Schroeders need even more is your dueling talent.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.530
You need me?

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:30.170
Yes.  It's time to use your strength to help the Schroeders.

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:32.800
Brother, I’ll do anything!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:36.180
Anything to help you!

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:50.920
So to help my brother, I'll defeat you, Yugi!

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:51.860
Leon…

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:55.720
This doesn’t feel right.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:59.650
My other self, I don't want to duel him.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.500
But Leon means business.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:08.030
I summon Iron Hans in attack position!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:15.870
When it's summoned, I can Special Summon Iron Knight from my deck!

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:18.370
Just watch.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:23.360
If my brother needs me, I'll win for him!

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.060
I Special Summon Iron Knight!

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:35.410
Good, Leonheart.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.390
Let's fight!

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:17.660
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:33.380
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:39.220
Without a goal in mind

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:47.790
We just step towards our dream

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:53.430
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:53.620 --> 00:23:01.900
Your eye will find it

00:23:02.260 --> 00:23:07.710
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:15.850
Will touch your soul

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:19.110
In a duel

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:34.090
It's the climax of the KC Grand Prix to determine the Duel King!

00:23:34.090 --> 00:23:38.770
I can't believe Leon is Sieg's brother!

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:44.000
He was having fun dueling, but he's now hostile towards Yugi.

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:47.010
Is this really what you want, Leon?

00:23:47.010 --> 00:23:52.380
And what's that card he received from Sieg?

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:55.910
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Golden Castle of Stromberg

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:57.400
Duel, standby!
